his words:
  FUTU  conditional maybe ok but not great, where's the runup and tightness
  CLR   conditional looks decent except 50ma is above and curling down
  NVTA  conditional maybe
  AZUL  conditional maybe, but looks like needs to build sideways tight more days
  W     conditional maybe
  MRNA  good        looks good
  X     no          no pull back or basing , I don't see a setup
  ZIM   no          don't see setup, it's in a large base
  LCID  no          no setup, gapped down and moved back into base/range, no breakout
  SWAV  no          choppy, very large bars (red), no tightness
  FLGT  no          random stock, nothing in it, no setup at all, large ranges, no run up
  F     no          nothing at all, downtrend, gap down, large bars, no setup at all
  MVIS  no          random, still in large range, no building higher lows, poor
  DVAX  no          no, choppy, volatile, large range and still within that range, gappy
  DQ    no          no
  HAPN  no          no
